# Trivy Ignore File for Cosine2.0 Terraform
# This file contains security findings to ignore during scans

# ALB HTTP Listener - Acceptable for staging environments without certificates
# In staging: HTTP listener forwards to target group for cost savings
# In production: HTTP listener redirects to HTTPS (certificate required)
# Rule: AVD-AWS-0054 - Listener for application load balancer does not use HTTPS
AVD-AWS-0054

# Note: This is conditionally acceptable because:
# 1. Staging environments don't require domain certificates (cost optimization)
# 2. Production environments will have certificates and redirect HTTP to HTTPS
# 3. The ALB configuration is designed to be secure when certificates are available
